flowchart TD
S([Open or edit shopping list]) --> G[US-15 authentication and owner gate]
G --> A{Action?}
A -- List --> L[200 owned items or empty list]
A -- Add --> V{Nonblank trimmed name?}
V -- No --> E[400; list unchanged]
V -- Yes --> C[Create unique owned name or return existing item]
C --> R[201 for new item; refresh list]
A -- Delete --> O{Selected entry owned?}
O -- No --> D[403 or 404; list unchanged]
O -- Yes --> X[Delete entry; 204]
L --> F([Inventory remains unchanged])
E --> F
R --> F
D --> F
X --> F
